{
 "encounter_id": "00684",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. Thank you for seeing me. I have been having pain in the upper right of my abdomen, after I eat fatty food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning, Mr Reddy. Tell me more about the pain. When does it come on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Usually an hour after a heavy meal, fried food especially. It is quite sharp, and it lasts for about two hours."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it spread anywhere?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sometimes to my right shoulder blade. And I feel nauseous along with it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often does it happen?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Perhaps once a week, since about three months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you been vomiting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not vomiting, but nausea, yes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any yellowing of your eyes or skin, or dark urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no yellowing. And my urine is normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever with the attacks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you taking anything at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just omeprazole, 20 mg once a day, for acidity."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I have type 2 diabetes, high cholesterol, and high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any family history of gallstones?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, my mother had her gallbladder removed, I believe in her fifties."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your diet, do you eat a lot of fried food?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I confess I love samosas and pakoras. I eat them most evenings."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you drink alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I do not drink."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Please. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 76, blood pressure 138 over 86, temperature 36.7, oxygen 98 percent, weight 88 kilos.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that acceptable? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little high on the pressure, but nothing alarming. Now, please lie back and breathe in deeply while I press under your right ribs. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh. That is the sore spot. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You are tender under the right ribs, especially when you breathe in.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it the gallbladder? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The pattern fits, and I will want to see it properly. I'd like to arrange an ultrasound scan of your abdomen, to look at the gallbladder and the liver."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When can I have it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Within two weeks. I'd also like a blood test to check your liver, pancreas and sugar."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Certainly. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Until then, please avoid fried and fatty food, and eat smaller, lighter meals."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That will be a sacrifice, but I understand. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the pain lasts more than six hours, or you develop a fever, or your skin turns yellow, come in the same day or go to the emergency department."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
